### ==========================================================================
### ENGINE 2: SCHEME MATCHING & PRECEDENCE
### ==========================================================================

### 2. Match Schemes for Rural SC/ST Woman Tailor (NSFDC / Mudra Eligible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available_margin": 14000.0,
  "is_women_entrepreneur": true,
  "is_sc_st": true,
  "is_greenfield": true,
  "annual_family_income": 220000.0,
  "is_rural": true,
  "trade_category": "tailor",
  "language": "hi"
}

### 3. Match Schemes for Greenfield Woman Entrepreneur (Stand-Up India Eligible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available_margin": 250000.0,
  "is_women_entrepreneur": true,
  "is_sc_st": false,
  "is_greenfield": true,
  "annual_family_income": 600000.0,
  "is_rural": true,
  "trade_category": "dairy",
  "language": "en"
}

### 4. Calculate Quarterly Moratorium-Aware EMI for Matched Scheme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/match/NSFDC_MAHILA_SAMRIDHI/emi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available_margin": 14000.0,
  "is_women_entrepreneur": true,
  "is_sc_st": true,
  "is_greenfield": true,
  "annual_family_income": 220000.0,
  "is_rural": true,
  "trade_category": "tailor",
