### ==========================================================================
### DIGILOCKER & DOCUMENT READINESS
### ==========================================================================

### 5. DigiLocker PKCE Authorize URL Generation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/digilocker/authorize?state=demo_test_state_123
Accept: application/json

### 6. DigiLocker Token Verification & Document Sync (Mock Mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/digilocker/verify-and-sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "sample_mock_auth_code_xyz",
  "code_verifier": "sample_pkce_code_verifier_1234567890_abcdef"
}

### 7. Document Readiness Evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schemes/document-readiness
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheme_code": "NSFDC_MAHILA_SAMRIDHI",
  "applicant_full_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "applicant_date_of_birth": "1992-08-15",
  "is_sc_st": true,
  "digilocker_verified_documents": {
    "aadhaar": true,
    "pan": true,
    "caste_certificate": true,
    "income_certificate": true
  },
  "submitted_documents": [
    {
      "document_type": "BANK_PASSBOOK",
      "manual_name": "Priya Sharma",
      "manual_id_number": "SBI-12345678"
    },
    {
      "document_type": "ADDRESS_PROOF",
      "manual_name": "Priya Sharma",
      "manual_id_number": "EPIC-987654"
    },
    {
      "document_type": "PASSPORT_PHOTO",
      "manual_name": "Priya Sharma"
    }
  ]
}


